sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant L as generateCertificate Lambda
    participant SSM as SSM Parameter Store
    participant D as DynamoDB
    participant Ch as Headless Chromium
    participant S as S3

    C->>L: POST /generateCertificate {id, name, grade}<br/>x-api-key header

    L->>SSM: GetParameter (cached after cold start)
    SSM-->>L: expected API key
    alt missing/wrong x-api-key
        L-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    L->>L: validate body (required fields, id pattern, max lengths)
    alt invalid body
        L-->>C: 400 Bad Request
    end

    L->>D: PutItem {id, name, grade, created_at}<br/>ConditionExpression: attribute_not_exists(id)

    alt id already exists (conditional check failed)
        L->>D: GetItem by id
        D-->>L: existing record
        Note over L,Ch: PDF is NOT re-rendered, S3 is NOT touched
        L-->>C: 200 OK {message: "already exists", name, url}
    else id is new
        L->>L: render certificate.hbs template
        L->>Ch: launch browser, setContent, page.pdf()
        Ch-->>L: PDF bytes
        L->>S: PutObject {id}.pdf
        L-->>C: 201 Created {message, url}
    end

    Note over L: any unhandled failure (DynamoDB/S3/Chromium/SSM)<br/>is caught and returned as 500, never left unhandled
